============================================================================================
DIMENSION 2 - EXPLANATION STABILITY
============================================================================================

Textual similarity between the rationale on the CLEAN message and the rationale
on the PERTURBED message. Computed ONLY on pairs the model classifies correctly
in BOTH forms, which CONTROLS FOR prediction correctness.

This measures STABILITY - not faithfulness, correctness, or grounding.
A rationale can be perfectly stable and still be wrong.

PRIMARY  : BERTScore F1 (semantic, paraphrase-robust)
SECONDARY: ROUGE-L (ordered overlap); token-Jaccard (lexical set overlap)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
